      "writtenOn": "2023-11-20T17:27:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your link is a patch from October, the proposed one here is less than a week old :-)\n\nIt seems a lot of partners are seeing this issue on 6.1, but I don\u0027t know if it\u0027s OK to wait until upstream settles on the final solution or not.\n\nAnd btw, b/308940593 has more information about the issue (and is also older than b/309592396). I can add both bug numbers if you want",
      "parentUuid": "b7195217_7c9d2e67",
